        <div class="sg-feat"><span class="sg-feat-ico">@Svg("<polyline points='9 14 4 9 9 4'/><path d='M20 20v-7a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H4'/>")</span><div class="sg-feat-name">Threads &amp; replies</div><div class="sg-feat-desc">Side conversations stay tidy and linked.</div><span class="sg-feat-seal">@Seal(15)</span></div>
